sysible-platform-apps (0.1.0) sysible; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: offer SLOP, Controller, SLEP and Connect as checkboxes on
    the installer's Optional-apps page. Until now the Workstation install
    offered no way to set the platform apps up at all -- they were a desktop
    launcher nobody is told about -- while the Server install has asked since
    its sysible/apps debconf question. Reported as "I got fairly far in the
    install process and did not see a menu to install slop, slep or controller".

 -- Sysible <maintainers@sysible.com>  Tue, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
